  "question": {
    "text": "For the function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, which one of the following is NOT correct?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is increasing in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; and decreasing in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;has exactly two solutions",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;has a root in the interval&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;has a maxima at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;has two solution as the curve of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will cut it at exactly two points.</p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>e</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>e</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>e</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
  }
